# Google Maps Platform key with the Solar API + Geocoding API enabled.
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials.
# Enable: "Solar API", "Geocoding API" and "Street View Static API" (the last one powers the
# proposal's showroom mockup photo — without it the mockup falls back to an illustrated house).
# Google Maps gives ~$200/mo free credit.
# Local dev: put the real value in a .env file (gitignored). Production: set it as a
# Cloudflare Pages environment variable of the same name.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API key — powers the REAL Ovi operator (Claude drives the CRM via tools).
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com → Settings → API Keys (starts "sk-ant-...").
# Local dev: put the real value in .env (gitignored) and restart `npm run dev`.
# Production: set it as a Cloudflare Pages environment variable of the same name.
# Without it, the app falls back to the built-in deterministic Ovi engine.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional — override the model (default: claude-opus-5). e.g. claude-sonnet-5 for lower cost.
OVI_MODEL=

# OpenAI key — powers the REAL "solar panels on your roof" AI render on the proposal/showroom
# cover (gpt-image-1, image-to-image edit of the real Street View photo). This is a PAID call,
# roughly $0.02-$0.19 per image generated. Get one at https://platform.openai.com → API keys.
# gpt-image-1 also requires your OpenAI organization to be verified — Settings → Organization →
# Verify — otherwise the edits call 403s and this silently falls back to the free composite.
# Needs GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (Street View Static API) set too. Without this key, the app falls
# back to a free canvas-composited overlay (real photo + a stylised panel grid drawn on top).
OPENAI_API_KEY=
